{"id":"vod_sn_38477","vodId":"38477","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"梦之祭","name_cn":"梦之祭","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/353e07b760c1079a87d80199d017fe35.jpg"},"summary":"天宫奏（石原壮马 配音）是一位十分平凡的高中生，却在一次偶然之中被拥有超高人气的偶像三神先生所发掘，加入了他的偶像事务所中。对偶像将要进行的活动几乎一无所知的奏，就这样在半推半就之下被推上了舞台中亚。　　和奏一起进行着偶像训练的还有个性沉着冷静，表面冷漠实际上十分热心的及川慎（沟口琢矢 配音）、自带偶像气场，过分自我而会忽略他人感受的佐佐木纯哉（富田健太郎 配音）、虽然个性温柔但却潜藏了无比巨大的能量的片桐伊月（太田将熙 配音）以及拥有娇小可爱的身材，个性也天真烂漫的泽村千弦（正木郁 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DgCa57YXKM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vm1ftNiv8G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gJC73eELsP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G0YQV6nrrw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h6vp4hm4N91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6sxDAcWCkX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RwYLZsVRSF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sWtZ64PkW71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z55zTRr7B01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NtFndXVkfZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hjg1f7t20s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4DNc1H1FBZ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.525Z"}